{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A cave full resources, a single exit, two companies...\u00a0</strong><br><strong>What could go wrong ?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this team based online multiplayer game, <strong>trust is a luxury</strong>.\u00a0Explore, upgrade your equipment, and gather resources as you race against your secret opponents. Don\u2019t show mercy \u2014 they won\u2019t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features :</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One goal, two hidden teams:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every player secretly works for one of two competing companies. Everyone wants gold. Everyone wants out. But only your team\u2019s haul counts toward victory. Cooperate \u2014 or quietly get in the others' way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore and upgrade:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine resources to improve your gear, craft tools, and deploy oxygen relays to reach deeper into the cave. Search for crates, discover hidden paths, and watch your back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gadgets over guns:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collapse tunnels, reveal loyalties, open new paths \u2014 or throw in some chaos. There\u2019s no combat, but tools can make or break a run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn who to trust (before it's too late):</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use gadgets to discover other's company. Make temporary allies... Just don't let them fool you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587410/extras/1f750a9547e90b32f9ab681c1c759a64.avif?t=1752240789\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587410/extras_big/1f750a9547e90b32f9ab681c1c759a64.avif?t=1752240789 width=800 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1587410?t=1752240789","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1587410?t=1752240789","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587410/a550c5a59273a8f5d3aab956ac2abc4d53ce1e49/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752240789","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587410/a550c5a59273a8f5d3aab956ac2abc4d53ce1e49/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752240789","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A cave full resources, a single exit, two companies...\u00a0</strong><br><strong>What could go wrong ?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this team based online multiplayer game, <strong>trust is a luxury</strong>.\u00a0Explore, upgrade your equipment, and gather resources as you race against your secret opponents. Don\u2019t show mercy \u2014 they won\u2019t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features :</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One goal, two hidden teams:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every player secretly works for one of two competing companies. Everyone wants gold. Everyone wants out. But only your team\u2019s haul counts toward victory. Cooperate \u2014 or quietly get in the others' way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore and upgrade:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine resources to improve your gear, craft tools, and deploy oxygen relays to reach deeper into the cave. Search for crates, discover hidden paths, and watch your back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gadgets over guns:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collapse tunnels, reveal loyalties, open new paths \u2014 or throw in some chaos. There\u2019s no combat, but tools can make or break a run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn who to trust (before it's too late):</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use gadgets to discover other's company. Make temporary allies... Just don't let them fool you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587410/extras/1f750a9547e90b32f9ab681c1c759a64.avif?t=1752240789\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587410/extras_big/1f750a9547e90b32f9ab681c1c759a64.avif?t=1752240789 width=800 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["GreedyMinersCorporation"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587410/f3e419af8bcd80f446daf398c842676b98fe5ffe/header.jpg?t=1752240789","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 GreedyMinersCorporation. All rights reserved.<br />\r\nDeveloped using Unity\u00ae. Unity is a trademark or registered trademark of Unity Technologies or its affiliates in the U.S. and elsewhere.<br />\r\n","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Big Sur 11 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon, x64 architecture with SSE2<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Metal capable Intel a